id=void-wall
name=VOID//WALL
version=1.3
versionCode=4
author=privshell
description=ADB-based firewall — full per-app blocking without root (Android Chain 3), background-data restriction (netpolicy), and real iptables/LAN rules for rooted devices (behind an explicit consent gate). 44 ready-made recipes across 9 categories, including IPv6 controls. Per-app data usage monitor, JSON import/export, panic button. Optional bring-your-own-key AI assistant (OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, Mistral, xAI, local).
webui=webui
usesShellBridge=true
